[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3463093818","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112166#issuecomment-3463093818","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112166","id":3463093818,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Oap46","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T18:28:26Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T18:28:26Z","body":"This has nothing to do with `Array.get` / `Array.pop_back` specifically, they return just fine. It is more about where such result is used.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nvar _my_arr: Array[Node] = []\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar node := Node.new()\n\t_my_arr.append(node)\n\tnode.free()\n\t\n\tvar array_get_result = _my_arr.get(0) # Fine.\n\t\n\tvar untyped_var = array_get_result # No error.\n\tvar typed_var: Node = array_get_result # Trying to assign invalid previously freed instance.\t\n\tfoo(array_get_result) # Invalid type in function 'foo' in base 'Node (node.tscn::GDScript_0e48y)'. The Object-derived class of argument 1 (previously freed) is not a subclass of the expected argument class.\n\nfunc foo(node: Node) -> void:\n\tpass\n```\n\nI'd suspect this is intended / by-design, I doubt something like that would be overlooked. Let's wait for the GDScript for clarification.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3463093818/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3467295924","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112166#issuecomment-3467295924","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112166","id":3467295924,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Oqry0","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T10:43:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T10:43:55Z","body":"I think these bugs are related https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110511, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110509","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url